 "sentences": [
  "Remember the door plug that blew out over Portland in January twenty twenty-four?",
  "The failure didn't start on that flight.",
  "The N - T - S - B found the plug likely walked itself upward over one hundred and fifty-four flights.",
  "From outside, the change was about half an inch, too small to catch on a walk-around.",
  "How it stayed in that long is in the full investigation.",
  "Margin of Error."
